## Common Questions

### Why do my ads get clicks but no conversions?

Almost always a mismatch rather than a traffic problem. The ad promised something specific and the page that loaded was general, or asked for more commitment than someone at that stage is ready to give, or simply took too long to load on a phone. Clicks mean the targeting and the message are doing their job. Conversions failing after the click means the problem is on your side of the handoff, which is good news, because that part you control entirely.

### What is a good conversion rate for a landing page?

